{"id": "gc-indi-87fd0738", "d": "add", "leaf": "P1.1.1/2", "page": "1:21:0", "mcq": {"s": "In which epic is it said, \"What is here is also found elsewhere, but what is not here is found nowhere else\"?", "o": ["Ramayana", "Mahabharata", "Bhagavad Gita", "Rajatarangini"], "a": 1, "x": "The Mahabharata claims of itself 'yad ihasti tad anyatra, yan nehasti na tat kvachit' – whatever is here may be found elsewhere, what is not here is found nowhere.", "src": "UPPSC (Pre) 1992"}}
